  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 303.02 Request for Reasonable Accommodation for Disability in the Administration of the National Physical Therapy Examination. Applicants seeking reasonable accommodations for disabilities in the administration of the national physical therapy examination shall do so through the FSBPT.\n\nSource. #9369, eff 1-24-09; ss by #9545, eff 9-19-09; ss by #12087, eff 1-20-17; ss by #12864, eff 9-10-19; ss by #14563, eff 6-20-26, EXPIRES: 6-20-36",
